gration changes require final human validation despite comprehensive test coverage.\n\n**Review effort:** Balanced  \n**Findings:** None\n\n<details>\n<summary><strong>Resolved since last review (1)</strong></summary>\n\n- <picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.svg\"><img src=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.png\" alt=\"Medium severity\" width=\"62\" height=\"18\" align=\"texttop\"></picture> [Retrying a failed ref load hits a leftover staging directory](#discussion_r4175742416)\n</details>","comment_id":null,"key":"review:5403911178","kind":"body","line":null,"path":null,"review_id":5403911178},{"body":"<!-- ccr-overview-v2 -->\n\n## Copilot review overview\n\n### \ud83d\udd35 Needs a closer look\n\nThe production execution migration is broad and the processor summary currently misreports continuation outcomes as successes.\n\n**Review effort:** Balanced  \n**Findings:** 1 <picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.svg\"><img src=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.png\" alt=\"Medium severity\" width=\"62\" height=\"18\" align=\"texttop\"></picture>\n\n<details open>\n<summary><strong>Open (1)</strong></summary>\n\n- <picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.svg\"><img src=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.png\" alt=\"Medium severity\" width=\"62\" height=\"18\" align=\"texttop\"></picture> [Count continued outcomes separately in process_claims summaries](#discussion_r4198617138) \u00b7 New\n</details>","comment_id":null,"key":"review:5432440207","kind":"body","line":null,"path":null,"review_id":5432440207},{"body":"Adding `continue` as a nonterminal outcome leaves `process_claims()`'s summary inconsistent: its `successes` calculation subtracts only retries and dead letters, so every bounded backfill slice acknowledged as `continue` is reported as a success. Track/subtract continued outcomes (and ideally expose a `continues` count) so processor summaries do not imply completion before full publication.","comment_commit_id":"c2af0bb7074454a99d7fc7d33293c57b4bf7627c","comment_id":4198617138,"key":"inline:4198617138","kind":"inline","line":258,"original_commit_id":"c2af0bb7074454a99d7fc7d33293c57b4bf7627c","original_line":258,"path":".github/scripts/pull-request-dashboard/process_queue_batch.py","review_commit_id":"c2af0bb7074454a99d7fc7d33293c57b4bf7627c","review_id":5432440207,"review_submitted_at":"2026-10-06T17:46:03Z","root_author":{"id":175728472,"node_id":"BOT_kgDOCnlnWA","type":"Bot"},"thread_context":[{"author":{"id":175728472,"node_id":"BOT_kgDOCnlnWA","type":"Bot"},"body_hash":"5667ff3162e7efdb9c905a9c09a912ce72775f894d141100a8cbb3b2df9e1dcf","id":4198617138,"parent":null,"updated_at":"2026-10-06T17:46:03Z"}],"thread_id":"PRRT_kwDOTENyc86plwIM"}],"frozen_at":1791309125,"frozen_at_iso":"2026-10-06T17:52:05Z","frozen_sha":"c2af0bb7074454a99d7fc7d33293c57b4bf7627c","head_ref":"trask-dashboard-execution-ownership","head_repo":"open-telemetry/shared-workflows","head_repo_id":1279488627,"launch_run":{"actor_id":218610,"attempt":1,"id":37502998241},"loop_kind":"copilot_review","mode":"publis